# David.md - David Mental Model

Source document introducing "David" as a universal mental model — a conceptual tool for understanding patterns and relationships in complex situations. References David Allen's work, specifically "Ready for Anything". Cross-references [[david-allen]] and [[getting-things-done---david-allen]].
